# ---- generated data (rebuild with the pipeline; see README) ----
# Step 1 output is COMMITTED, not ignored: run_a.json, run_b.json and metadata.json
# are in the repo so you can start at step 2 without a GPU. If you re-run step 1
# with your own prompts, those three files are simply overwritten.

# Step 2 output
run_*_projected.json
projection_matrix.npy
projection_meta.json

# Step 3 output - ~500 MB combined, never commit
run_*_semantic_motion_v2.json

# Step 4 output - the compact trajectories the viewer reads
viewer/public/data/

